        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8450, Single Cylinder Brass Regular Style Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Regular Single Cylinder Deadbolt will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will fit doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets with thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/regular-double-cylinder-deadbolt-emtek-8350-1213453\"><b>Regular Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Regular Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1⁄4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
